# 测试规范

## 测试框架

### 单元测试: Vitest
```typescript
// vitest.config.ts
import { defineConfig } from 'vitest/config';

export default defineConfig({
  test: {
    globals: true,
    environment: 'jsdom',
    include: ['src/**/*.test.ts', 'tests/unit/**/*.ts'],
    coverage: {
      reporter: ['text', 'html'],
      exclude: ['node_modules/', 'tests/'],
    },
  },
});
```

### E2E测试: Playwright
```typescript
// playwright.config.ts
